items.Nakasar_Fractal_Mist_Potion_Offensive.name = Mist Offensive Potion
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Mist_Potion_Offensive.description = Drink (hold right click): one stack of Fractal Offensive for 1 h; outgoing damage in fractals +3% per stack (conditions included). Stacks up to 5 times, each drink resets the duration to 1 h. No effect outside fractals. Sold by Dessa's Alchemist, in the Observatory.
